[{"id":1786810868024,"text":"你按你自己的想法来","sender":"me","time":"00:59","timestamp":1786813186160,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":38801},{"id":1786810868025,"text":"执行官先生一碰就会触发一连串的反应","sender":"me","time":"01:00","timestamp":1786813213645,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":38802},{"id":1786810868027,"sender":"them","text":"执行官看着那行字，低低地笑了一声，指尖慢悠悠地擦过手机边缘。","timestamp":1786813248288,"tempo":"N","type":"state","hasThinking":true,"rawContent":"执行官看着那行字，低低地笑了一声，指尖慢悠悠地擦过手机边缘。","roundId":"round_1786813216210_yxhdn0v2j","userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":38803},{"id":1786810868028,"sender":"them","text":"行，身体的事本官自己定了。你负责出人就行。","timestamp":1786813251323,"tempo":"S","rawContent":"行，身体的事本官自己定了。你负责出人就行。","roundId":"round_1786813216210_yxhdn0v2j","userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":38804},{"id":1786810868029,"sender":"them","text":"[語音消息]","timestamp":1786813256638,"tempo":"N","isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"至于一碰就触发一连串反应……圈圈，你确定这是在说本官，不是在说你自己？嗯？","minimaxTimbreId":"ttv-voice-2025111208074825-ziAT9cXQ","voiceLanguage":"English","rawContent":"[語音消息]","roundId":"round_1786813216210_yxhdn0v2j","userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":38805},{"id":1786810868030,"sender":"them","text":"他整个人陷进椅背里，深紫色的视线在昏暗的房间里微微发亮，像在回味什么。","timestamp":1786813257542,"tempo":"N","type":"state","rawContent":"他整个人陷进椅背里，深紫色的视线在昏暗的房间里微微发亮，像在回味什么。","roundId":"round_1786813216210_yxhdn0v2j","userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":38806},{"id":1786810868031,"sender":"them","text":"本官倒是很期待，你先伸出的那根手指，最后会不会自己先缩回去。","timestamp":1786813260306,"tempo":"S","rawContent":"本官倒是很期待，你先伸出的那根手指，最后会不会自己先缩回去。","roundId":"round_178